    "updated_at": "2026-10-30T14:35:33Z",
    "body": "From tpac discussion: when a site is embedded by a cross origin site, maybe there should be a policy that allows the embedder to know when the embedded site is render unblocked. This could be implemented in a meta tag in the embedded document, and could be placed right next to the render blocking tag in the head of the embedded document.",
